{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-29","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：平行六面体与平行线与线段","englishTitle":"Parallelepipedal solids which are on the same base and of the same height, and in which the extremities of the sides which stand up are on the same straight lines, are equal to one another.","book":11,"number":29,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.29","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.29/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":29,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","contentId":"euclid-11-29","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b949b9d033c334d4a042aae7cf0c3acc7654c69c3f6452dcf9c948ce12e4ce9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-29.statement","euclid-11-29.construction.1","euclid-11-29.proof.1","euclid-11-29.construction.2","euclid-11-29.proof.2","euclid-11-29.proof.3","euclid-11-29.proof.4","euclid-11-29.construction.3","euclid-11-29.conclusion","euclid-11-29.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-29.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"616ecf1504c9195e27b42f06cb759e14301e721bd996651fd71661fd0ebaa487","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Parallelepipedal solids which are on the same base and of the same height, and in which the extremities of the sides which stand up are on the same straight lines, are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平行管道固体在底边和同一高度,站立的两侧的高度在同一直线上,它们彼此相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-29.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29b50abbdfdb94561ba65c6d4b211f448f2b92fc1fafe45e0f5729d656e5b453","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let CM, CN be parallelepipedal solids on the same base AB and of the same height, and let the extremities of their sides which stand up, namely AG, AF, LM, LN, CD, CE, BH, BK, be on the same straight lines FN, DK; I say that the solid CM is equal to the solid CN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让同一底边 AB和同一高度的CM CN平行管道固体,让它们站立的两侧的极限,即AG、AF、LM、LN、CD、CE、BH、BK,在同一直线上FN、DK;我说,固体CM等于固体CN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-29.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"006a5d19e3422cd30074171e0078394c92da652da301cf267de9023902d6e3cc","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since each of the figures CH, CK is a parallelogram, CB is equal to each of the straight lines DH, EK, [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] hence DH is also equal to EK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为CH,CK是平行四边形,CB等于DH,EK,因此DH也等于EK。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-29.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"482c6001cbceb4d96e0708e383fd54473c4ce41018c10ad360d35fa661b1eeb4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EH be subtracted from each; therefore the remainder DE is equal to the remainder HK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每人减去EH美元,其余DE美元等于其余HK美元。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-29.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52f415b314266ea3d02e40f91caffdcae19e275e1ce4ef5c3715172c60b81167","citations":["euclid-1-8","euclid-1-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence the triangle DCE is also equal to the triangle HBK, [[I. 8, 4](/principles/euclid-1-8)] and the parallelogram DG to the parallelogram HN. [[I. 36](/principles/euclid-1-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形DCE也等于三角形HBK,而三角形平行四边形 DG至平行四边形 HN。 [[I. 8, 4](/principles/euclid-1-8)] [[I. 36](/principles/euclid-1-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-29.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"788a0533aac32fdf461821b703710db7f5635e6ce16d5daf87b839cca8756d82","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the triangle AFG is also equal to the triangle MLN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,三角形AFG也等于三角形MLN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-29.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98b78841b89833b1e9e0079a92c3f3e92da4546bb1b83771f76c12903141f172","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the parallelogram CF is equal to the parallelogram BM, and CG to BN, for they are opposite; therefore the prism contained by the two triangles AFG, DCE and the three parallelograms AD, DG, CG is equal to the prism contained by the two triangles MLN, HBK and the three parallelograms BM, HN, BN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,平行四边形 CF等于平行四边形 BM和CG至BN,因为它们是相反的;因此,由两个三角构成的棱镜,即AFG、DCE和3 平行四边形 AD、DG、CG,等同于由两个三角构成的棱镜,即MLN、HBK和3 平行四边形 BM、HN、BN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-29.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d34749635160c4a1a877fe24b42a9a0ced05240e86afa5efbfe0964161b36db8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be added to each the solid of which the parallelogram AB is the base and GEHM its opposite; therefore the whole parallelepipedal solid CM is equal to the whole parallelepipedal solid CN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每一固体中,平行四边形 AB是底边,GEHM是相反的;因此,整个平行管道固体CM等于整个平行管道固体CN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-29.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-29.source","contentId":"euclid-11-29","revisionId":"euclid-11-29@raw-1b949b9d033c334d","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7524eed31deb25defe16